{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deck of Treads is a chaotic 2-6 player tank brawler with a deckbuilding twist. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The losers of each round pick powerful upgrades, stacking wild abilities that change how you play. Every match escalates into unpredictable mayhem with hilarious, over-the-top tank builds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321160/extras/Titanium_AboutPage_BattleText_03.png?t=1745986085\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brawl with friends in ever-changing, procedurally generated arenas where no two matches are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321160/extras/Titanium_AboutGif_07.gif?t=1745986085\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321160/extras/Titanium_AboutPage_UpgradeText_01.png?t=1745986085\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The losers of each round choose powerful upgrades that transform their tanks. With endless combos and wild synergies, no two builds play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321160/extras/TitaniumGIF_CardSelect.gif?t=1745986085\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321160/extras/Titanium_AboutPage_RepeatText_01.png?t=1745986085\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump back in as chaos escalates and tanks evolve into unstoppable (and ridiculous) machines!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321160/extras/Titanium_AboutGif_08.gif?t=1745986085\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackgro